      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Occasionally you may need to keep multiple discrete sets of children with differing slot requirements.\nThis data structure can be used to link multiple FChildren under a single accessor so you can always return\nall children from GetChildren, but internally manage them in their own child lists."
